{
  "script_id": "quadric-surfaces",
  "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
  "voice_key": "xiaoxiao",
  "files": [
    {
      "script_id": "quadric-surfaces",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-1",
      "filename": "intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/quadric-surfaces/xiaoxiao/intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "duration": 4.65,
      "size": 74448,
      "text": "在平面上，二元二次方程给出的曲线只有三类：椭圆、抛物线、双曲线。这个结论很干净，也是解析几何最漂亮的成果之一。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "quadric-surfaces",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-2",
      "filename": "intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/quadric-surfaces/xiaoxiao/intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.96,
      "size": 47376,
      "text": "那么升到三维会怎样？三元二次方程的项数从六个涨到十个，看起来复杂得多。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "quadric-surfaces",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-3",
      "filename": "intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/quadric-surfaces/xiaoxiao/intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.02,
      "size": 48384,
      "text": "但答案同样干净：非退化的实二次曲面，一共只有六类。今天我们把它们一次看全。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "quadric-surfaces",
      "section_id": "bounded",
      "line_id": "bd-1",
      "filename": "bounded-bd-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/quadric-surfaces/xiaoxiao/bounded-bd-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.72,
      "size": 59472,
      "text": "第一类是椭球面，方程是三个平方项相加等于一。三个系数全都同号，这是它区别于其他类型的标志。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "quadric-surfaces",
      "section_id": "bounded",
      "line_id": "bd-2",
      "filename": "bounded-bd-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/quadric-surfaces/xiaoxiao/bounded-bd-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.46,
      "size": 55440,
      "text": "它是六类里唯一有界的曲面，像一个被压扁或拉长的球。三个半轴相等时就退化成标准的球面。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "quadric-surfaces",
      "section_id": "bounded",
      "line_id": "bd-3",
      "filename": "bounded-bd-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/quadric-surfaces/xiaoxiao/bounded-bd-3.mp3",
      "duration": 2.53,
      "size": 40464,
      "text": "地球的形状就近似是一个椭球面，赤道方向略胖，两极方向略扁。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "quadric-surfaces",
      "section_id": "hyperboloid",
      "line_id": "hy-1",
      "filename": "hyperboloid-hy-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/quadric-surfaces/xiaoxiao/hyperboloid-hy-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.94,
      "size": 63072,
      "text": "把椭球面方程里一个平方项前面的加号改成减号，就得到单叶双曲面。它的腰部收紧，上下两端向外张开。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "quadric-surfaces",
      "section_id": "hyperboloid",
      "line_id": "hy-2",
      "filename": "hyperboloid-hy-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/quadric-surfaces/xiaoxiao/hyperboloid-hy-2.mp3",
      "duration": 4.35,
      "size": 69552,
      "text": "这个形状你一定见过：火力发电厂的冷却塔就是它。选它不是为了好看，而是因为它是直纹面，能用笔直的钢筋搭出来。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "quadric-surfaces",
      "section_id": "hyperboloid",
      "line_id": "hy-3",
      "filename": "hyperboloid-hy-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/quadric-surfaces/xiaoxiao/hyperboloid-hy-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.68,
      "size": 58896,
      "text": "再改一个符号变成两个负号，曲面就断成了两片，这叫双叶双曲面。它是六类里唯一不连通的曲面。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "quadric-surfaces",
      "section_id": "paraboloid",
      "line_id": "pa-1",
      "filename": "paraboloid-pa-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/quadric-surfaces/xiaoxiao/paraboloid-pa-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.56,
      "size": 57024,
      "text": "如果方程里 z 只出现一次方，得到的是抛物面。两个平方项同号时是椭圆抛物面，一个标准的碗。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "quadric-surfaces",
      "section_id": "paraboloid",
      "line_id": "pa-2",
      "filename": "paraboloid-pa-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/quadric-surfaces/xiaoxiao/paraboloid-pa-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.01,
      "size": 48096,
      "text": "卫星天线和探照灯反射镜用的就是这个形状，因为它能把平行光精确聚到一个焦点上。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "quadric-surfaces",
      "section_id": "paraboloid",
      "line_id": "pa-3",
      "filename": "paraboloid-pa-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/quadric-surfaces/xiaoxiao/paraboloid-pa-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.43,
      "size": 54864,
      "text": "两个平方项反号时变成双曲抛物面，也就是马鞍面。它既处处是鞍点，又能被两族直线铺满。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "quadric-surfaces",
      "section_id": "cone",
      "line_id": "co-1",
      "filename": "cone-co-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/quadric-surfaces/xiaoxiao/cone-co-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.21,
      "size": 51408,
      "text": "最后一类是二次锥面。它的方程和单叶双曲面几乎一样，只是右边的一不见了，变成了零。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "quadric-surfaces",
      "section_id": "cone",
      "line_id": "co-2",
      "filename": "cone-co-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/quadric-surfaces/xiaoxiao/cone-co-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.84,
      "size": 61488,
      "text": "少了这个一，曲面的腰部就收缩成一个点。请拖动参数观察，锥面正是双曲面腰部收紧到极限的结果。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "quadric-surfaces",
      "section_id": "cone",
      "line_id": "co-3",
      "filename": "cone-co-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/quadric-surfaces/xiaoxiao/cone-co-3.mp3",
      "duration": 4.08,
      "size": 65232,
      "text": "注意顶点那里曲面不光滑，所以严格说它是退化情形。用平面切它，切出来的正好是平面上那三类圆锥曲线。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "quadric-surfaces",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-1",
      "filename": "summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/quadric-surfaces/xiaoxiao/summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.79,
      "size": 60624,
      "text": "第一，非退化实二次曲面只有六类：椭球面、单叶与双叶双曲面、椭圆与双曲抛物面、二次锥面。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "quadric-surfaces",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-2",
      "filename": "summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/quadric-surfaces/xiaoxiao/summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.66,
      "size": 42624,
      "text": "第二，决定类型的是平方项系数的符号组合，系数大小只改变胖瘦。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "quadric-surfaces",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-3",
      "filename": "summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/quadric-surfaces/xiaoxiao/summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.87,
      "size": 61920,
      "text": "第三，单叶双曲面和双曲抛物面都是直纹面，这让它们在建筑上格外好用。感谢观看，我们下次再见。"
    }
  ],
